    {
      "id": "claim_018dfcbd3d864c5f9a2e29b562c37eca",
      "statement": "The user schema (USER_SCHEMA) requires only _id and roles fields, while password, profile, latestConsents, consents, and other fields are optional because the schema validates documents before initial team attachment and invited users are written with no password and empty profile until invitation is accepted. The acceptedAt field uses _$date (escaped BSON type key) to avoid parser misinterpretation.",
