    {
      "id": "claim_d2a6f5260f124cc186821097e6fcec45",
      "statement": "The orders-list-own permission uses a readFilter that reads @team._id (the active team resolved by the server at every request) to filter orders by billing account, not @user.team._id which is no longer in the token. The step's check reads the stored filter too, so a service set up before the change is detected and rewritten.",
